{"sections":[{"slug":"拟仿射概形","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"拟仿射概形"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟仿射概形</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"拟仿射概形"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">拟仿射概形</span></strong> (quasi-affine scheme) <span lang=\"zh\">是满足如下等价条件的概形</span> $X$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$X$ "},{"Local":{"url":"/拟紧概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟紧</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">且同构于某个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/仿射概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/开嵌入","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">开子概形</span>"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">典范的映射</span> $X\\to \\operatorname{Spec}(\\mathcal O_X(X))$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟紧态射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟紧</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/开嵌入","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">开嵌入</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于拟仿射概形</span> $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">映射</span> $X\\to \\operatorname{Spec}(\\mathcal O_X(X))$ <span lang=\"zh\">称为</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">仿射闭包</span></strong> (affine closure), <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Sch}}(X,\\operatorname{Spec}A)\r\n\\simeq \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}(\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathcal O_X(X),\\operatorname{Spec}A),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">它是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/仿射概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射化</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的特例</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}